# [Project Title: Business Network Infrastructure Proposal]

**Date:** [September, 2024]
**Security Domain:** [Network Infrastructure]
**Tools & Hardware Used:** [Microsoft Visio, Windows Server 2022, Microsoft Excel]

1. Scenario & Objective

ACME Animation required a secure, scalable, and highly available infrastructure to support approximately 60 employees, including CGI developers, management, support staff, IT personnel, and remote workers. The objective of this project was to design a complete enterprise network and data center infrastructure that emphasized performance, security, redundancy, and future growth through network segmentation, virtualization, centralized management, and redundant connectivity.

